  "sourceTitle": "How Albertsons Companies is reimagining retail from the inside out",
  "sourceBodyHash": "378517c3f4970dc6dd101dff04e5df50279b52753dfa1319b92ff0f012ff8d47",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
